{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30623","headline":"送人归吴 · 姚鹄","name":"送人归吴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东吴与上国，万里路迢迢。\n爲别晨昏久，全轻水陆遥。\n湘阴岛上寺，楚色月中潮。\n到此一长望，知君积恨销。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30623.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30623","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}